fr3_bilateral_teleop

This package is a modified version of franka_ros2_teleop
  https://github.com/frankarobotics/franka_ros2_teleop
  commit 69ade0e3e3a344c277f0c159a37ff8bd95c30636
The original NOTICE follows unchanged.

Changes from the original:
  * Renamed the package, C++ namespace, include directory, plugin library and
    plugin class names from franka_ros2_teleop to fr3_bilateral_teleop, so both
    can be installed side by side.
  * Upgraded the leader/follower controllers to a 4-channel bilateral scheme with
    timing diagnostics, workspace constraints and payload handling (modified
    src/, include/, config/, launch/ files).
  * Added the PayloadModelBroadcaster controller, the stiffness-rate-limiter,
    energy-tank and Cartesian-impedance-math headers with their tests, the
    calibration/validation launch files and configs, the scripts/ pipeline, and
    the offline labeling/evaluation tools in dataset_tools/.
  * Removed the Docker, dev-container and CI files, which pointed at the
    original package's images.

